/* v6.25 — activate the whole team in one go (owner / HR).
   The team list shows how many people still have no account; «Activate all» makes a one-time code (48 h) for each of them and opens a list
   with a WhatsApp button per person — the message carries the link that opens the app with the code filled. Each person sets his own
   password; the codes are shown only on this screen (never stored in clear — only their hash, same as the single activation-code button). */
