/* =====================================================================
   v7.36 — a «back» button on every page (Mahmoud, 11 Oct: «when you go into any tab or icon there should be a back button»).
   · Every page except the home page itself (the icons home, or the dashboard / the person's first page) has «‹ Back» at the
     start of the top bar, where the small logo was. A tap goes back to the page you came from; if you opened the page
     directly (a link, a notification) a detail page goes up to its list and any other page to the home page.
   · On detail pages it replaces the old «back» on the other side, so there is only one.
   · Both looks (Advanced and Icons), phone and computer, Arabic and English, all three systems.
   ===================================================================== */
